(1798017, 244796, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wow - this would be great for Light on White too.  <br/> <br/>Beautiful detail. I wish there were better light on him, but the clarity more than makes up for it. The monochromatic theme works well. Love the beard. :~D</td>', 'Wow - this would be great for Light on White too.   Beautiful detail. I wish there were better light on him, but the clarity more than makes up for it. The monochromatic theme works well. Love the beard. :~D', '2005-10-20 09:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1798019, 245307, 15711, '<td valign="top">Dirty Urban sense to it. Great lighting.  The leading line really works and I like that there are figures placed in different areas, to guide the eye along. Perfect use of black and white.</td>', 'Dirty Urban sense to it. Great lighting.  The leading line really works and I like that there are figures placed in different areas, to guide the eye along. Perfect use of black and white.', '2005-10-20 09:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1798021, 245880, 15711, '<td valign="top">Yikes.  I never thought a pug could look so scary. LOL<br/> <br/>Great "in your face" sense to it.</td>', 'Yikes.  I never thought a pug could look so scary. LOL Great "in your face" sense to it.', '2005-10-20 09:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1798025, 245862, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is really interesting.  I know it''s some type of architecture, but just like the title and chalenge depict - WHAT???  It has a leading line and the blue really is soothing to the eye. I like it.</td>', 'This is really interesting.  I know it''s some type of architecture, but just like the title and chalenge depict - WHAT???  It has a leading line and the blue really is soothing to the eye. I like it.', '2005-10-20 09:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1798027, 246310, 15711, '<td valign="top">The look on this dog''s face is just priceless! The detail is terrific. You can almost count the hairs on his head.  Perfect lighting.  Intense eyes with great clarity.  8</td>', 'The look on this dog''s face is just priceless! The detail is terrific. You can almost count the hairs on his head.  Perfect lighting.  Intense eyes with great clarity.  8', '2005-10-20 09:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1798028, 245279, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the three different expressions of the girls. The lighting is good and I like the crop you chose.  I wish that the girl to the left was a tad more sharp. Love her hair!! It could just be the camera used. This is a candid shot, but well executed and nicely composed.</td>', 'I love the three different expressions of the girls. The lighting is good and I like the crop you chose.  I wish that the girl to the left was a tad more sharp. Love her hair!! It could just be the camera used. This is a candid shot, but well executed and nicely composed.', '2005-10-20 09:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1798029, 245982, 9780, '<td valign="top">LOL love it! Don''t know but whiter background and the no shadof cast could improfit... but you are getting 9 from me... :D</td>', 'LOL love it! Don''t know but whiter background and the no shadof cast could improfit... but you are getting 9 from me... :D', '2005-10-20 09:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1798032, 246129, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting horizontal placement.  Looks like a doll. I don''t know if you did a slight desat or not, but it works with the black background. I wish his face had a bit of light bouncing off of it. Good use of negative space. Not crazy about the long title, but that''s just me.</td>', 'Interesting horizontal placement.  Looks like a doll. I don''t know if you did a slight desat or not, but it works with the black background. I wish his face had a bit of light bouncing off of it. Good use of negative space. Not crazy about the long title, but that''s just me.', '2005-10-20 09:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1798034, 245945, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the golden tones of the background.  He almost has a blue cast, which works well as a complementary color to the yellows. I''d like to see him a bit less centered inthe shot. Maybe crop out the area to the right and zoom iin on him, so we could see more of his detail. Nice capture.</td>', 'I love the golden tones of the background.  He almost has a blue cast, which works well as a complementary color to the yellows. I''d like to see him a bit less centered inthe shot. Maybe crop out the area to the right and zoom iin on him, so we could see more of his detail. Nice capture.', '2005-10-20 09:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1798037, 245103, 15711, '<td valign="top">I wish the hook wsn''t covering most of his head. The DOF is spot on. Nicely lit as well.</td>', 'I wish the hook wsn''t covering most of his head. The DOF is spot on. Nicely lit as well.', '2005-10-20 09:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
