(1798721, 243922, 20075, '<td valign="top">Not a bad silouette photo, or a sunset, but I don''t see where the "What?!" comes in to play.<br/> <br/>To improve the photo in general, though: perhaps try to hold the camera a bit more steady, or use a tripod, if possible.  The edges around the trees are blurred, so I know there was some movement here.  Also, if you have a tripod, taking a longer exposure might bring out a little more detail in the leaves, which may improve the picture some.</td>', 'Not a bad silouette photo, or a sunset, but I don''t see where the "What?!" comes in to play. To improve the photo in general, though: perhaps try to hold the camera a bit more steady, or use a tripod, if possible.  The edges around the trees are blurred, so I know there was some movement here.  Also, if you have a tripod, taking a longer exposure might bring out a little more detail in the leaves, which may improve the picture some.', '2005-10-20 15:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
