(1798810, 246437, 43753, '<td valign="top">I get goosebumps when I look at this photo. I am not a big spider fan. I don''t kill them, but I do try to get as far away from them as possible. The only think I don''t like about this macro is the shine on the fabric.</td>', 'I get goosebumps when I look at this photo. I am not a big spider fan. I don''t kill them, but I do try to get as far away from them as possible. The only think I don''t like about this macro is the shine on the fabric.', '2005-10-20 16:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
