(1799941, 246390, 36597, '<td valign="top">Great idea... I''d like to see this larger. The focus and depth of field look off. Good luck.</td>', 'Great idea... I''d like to see this larger. The focus and depth of field look off. Good luck.', '2005-10-20 23:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799951, 245103, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good job of titling this to make it work with the image.  You can almost read the bird''s mind, like DANGIT!  NOW how am I going to eat my dinner?  ;^)<br/> <br/>Nice bg color and bokeh working here.  The curve of the iron arm creates a nice diagonal line an is naturally pleasing to the eye.<br/> <br/>Nice job!  Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Good job of titling this to make it work with the image.  You can almost read the bird''s mind, like DANGIT!  NOW how am I going to eat my dinner?  ;^) Nice bg color and bokeh working here.  The curve of the iron arm creates a nice diagonal line an is naturally pleasing to the eye. Nice job!  Good luck with the challenge.', '2005-10-20 23:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1799955, 245945, 30049, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image!  Looks like late day sun giving that golden glow. Tough to get the exposure correct, yet you did a nice job with this.  Nice mulie too!  Colorado perhaps?<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful image!  Looks like late day sun giving that golden glow. Tough to get the exposure correct, yet you did a nice job with this.  Nice mulie too!  Colorado perhaps? Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-10-20 23:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
