(1799970, 245768, 36597, '<td valign="top">I especially like the colour palette. Personally, I''d like to see the leaf ascue.<br/>That being said, congratulations and good luck. It is a nice photo.</td>', 'I especially like the colour palette. Personally, I''d like to see the leaf ascue.That being said, congratulations and good luck. It is a nice photo.', '2005-10-20 23:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
