(1800608, 246052, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the way the fur looks on the cat''s forehead. I wonder how this would look if cropped a bit differently? Meybe cropped in from the left to off-center the cat and give a little more at the top and bottom as the kitty''s head looks a bit...squished in the frame to me.</td>', 'I like the way the fur looks on the cat''s forehead. I wonder how this would look if cropped a bit differently? Meybe cropped in from the left to off-center the cat and give a little more at the top and bottom as the kitty''s head looks a bit...squished in the frame to me.', '2005-10-21 09:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800610, 244686, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I wish there was another element to add more interest to the subject. Say some floating leaves or a branch...or something.</td>', 'For me, I wish there was another element to add more interest to the subject. Say some floating leaves or a branch...or something.', '2005-10-21 09:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800611, 245279, 41675, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured their faces well. The lip of the girl in the front looks a bit pixeleated or over sharpened..or something (sorry, I''m not the best on technical critiques).</td>', 'You''ve captured their faces well. The lip of the girl in the front looks a bit pixeleated or over sharpened..or something (sorry, I''m not the best on technical critiques).', '2005-10-21 09:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800612, 244284, 46097, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The colours, mood, texture, all compliment each other. And I found myself saying "what?". Very nice.</td>', 'I really like this. The colours, mood, texture, all compliment each other. And I found myself saying "what?". Very nice.', '2005-10-21 09:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800616, 243355, 41675, '<td valign="top">Even with your title it''s hard for me to discern what the subject matter is. The photo seems pixelated too, therefore I have given it a lower score.</td>', 'Even with your title it''s hard for me to discern what the subject matter is. The photo seems pixelated too, therefore I have given it a lower score.', '2005-10-21 09:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800619, 245879, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and think you are onto something that could really be a cool shot. For me, I would have liked to have seen a bit more focus and there is some kind of black hairline in the lower right corner.</td>', 'I like the concept and think you are onto something that could really be a cool shot. For me, I would have liked to have seen a bit more focus and there is some kind of black hairline in the lower right corner.', '2005-10-21 09:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800622, 245766, 35357, '<td valign="top">I recognise those cows!</td>', 'I recognise those cows!', '2005-10-21 09:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800623, 244285, 41675, '<td valign="top">Neat sculptures (at least that''s what I''m guessing they are :-). For me, I would have liked to have seen it cropped in more on the right hand side. Cropping out that tree completely as I find it and the object in the background distracting. My favorite part is the "face" of the one on the left.</td>', 'Neat sculptures (at least that''s what I''m guessing they are :-). For me, I would have liked to have seen it cropped in more on the right hand side. Cropping out that tree completely as I find it and the object in the background distracting. My favorite part is the "face" of the one on the left.', '2005-10-21 09:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800625, 246006, 41675, '<td valign="top">My favorite part is the person itself, good clarity and colors. I wish the building on the right had been cropped out completely as I find it a bit distracting. Fun shot.</td>', 'My favorite part is the person itself, good clarity and colors. I wish the building on the right had been cropped out completely as I find it a bit distracting. Fun shot.', '2005-10-21 09:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800631, 246390, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hello. Looks like an interesting subject, but I wish the photo were larger. DPC allows us to submit photos up to 640 pixels max. For me, I get a better sense of a photo when it''s larger. Perhaps a bit more focus would also help as it seems a bit blurry overall.</td>', 'Hello. Looks like an interesting subject, but I wish the photo were larger. DPC allows us to submit photos up to 640 pixels max. For me, I get a better sense of a photo when it''s larger. Perhaps a bit more focus would also help as it seems a bit blurry overall.', '2005-10-21 09:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1800634, 243672, 46097, '<td valign="top">Lovely place. Nice picture....but I dont get it''s relevance to the theme.</td>', 'Lovely place. Nice picture....but I dont get it''s relevance to the theme.', '2005-10-21 09:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
