(1801389, 244663, 43753, '<td valign="top">Gosh - already have a carved pumpkin? It isn''t cool enough here in Ft. Worth to keep carved pumpkins out. We usually have to wait until the night before Halloween. The nose on the pumpkin reminds me of the way the noses are drawn in the old Popeye cartoons.</td>', 'Gosh - already have a carved pumpkin? It isn''t cool enough here in Ft. Worth to keep carved pumpkins out. We usually have to wait until the night before Halloween. The nose on the pumpkin reminds me of the way the noses are drawn in the old Popeye cartoons.', '2005-10-21 15:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
