(1802225, 246223, 30881, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W. like the feel and feel it would do well in the leisure section of newspape. Only picky point I''d make are the wild weeds obstructing models head. Snip off all the very tall ones prior to photographing. Overall very good shot. "8"</td>', 'Nice B&W. like the feel and feel it would do well in the leisure section of newspape. Only picky point I''d make are the wild weeds obstructing models head. Snip off all the very tall ones prior to photographing. Overall very good shot. "8"', '2005-10-21 21:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802228, 244281, 27847, '<td valign="top">That''s a cool shot of I would guess a tree trunk. It''s amazing what you can discover shooting close-up/macro ... it''s a whole new world. Nice Job.</td>', 'That''s a cool shot of I would guess a tree trunk. It''s amazing what you can discover shooting close-up/macro ... it''s a whole new world. Nice Job.', '2005-10-21 21:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
