(1802234, 246381, 27847, '<td valign="top">A little base jumping goes a long way, great caputre. Very sharp and interesting and I''m sure this guy know exactly WHAT he was thinking ;-) Good one...</td>', 'A little base jumping goes a long way, great caputre. Very sharp and interesting and I''m sure this guy know exactly WHAT he was thinking ;-) Good one...', '2005-10-21 21:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802236, 243653, 27847, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot and I really like the textured look of it. What? good question looks like clay or something like that.</td>', 'Interesting shot and I really like the textured look of it. What? good question looks like clay or something like that.', '2005-10-21 21:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802238, 244555, 30881, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the dogs sad expression. Unfortunately it is too bland, poor choice of location, needs to be sharper and more contrast. Great idea and good capture though.</td>', 'Great capture of the dogs sad expression. Unfortunately it is too bland, poor choice of location, needs to be sharper and more contrast. Great idea and good capture though.', '2005-10-21 21:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802247, 246343, 30881, '<td valign="top">Wonderful modernistic feel. Like the sharp ness on one side and blending into a blur on the other. Good work.</td>', 'Wonderful modernistic feel. Like the sharp ness on one side and blending into a blur on the other. Good work.', '2005-10-21 21:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802249, 246123, 27847, '<td valign="top">Yes, it certainly is a what question. Must have been a Balloon vendor up the road? ha ha. Over all I like it however a few things that could be improved is if they were walking into the frame instead of out by moving the camera left would have been very effective and would have taken out the disruptive car on the right. Also, I fine the photo a little dark (under exposed) would have been a better shot if you could see the details better on the two men. Still nicely done.</td>', 'Yes, it certainly is a what question. Must have been a Balloon vendor up the road? ha ha. Over all I like it however a few things that could be improved is if they were walking into the frame instead of out by moving the camera left would have been very effective and would have taken out the disruptive car on the right. Also, I fine the photo a little dark (under exposed) would have been a better shot if you could see the details better on the two men. Still nicely done.', '2005-10-21 21:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1802251, 244288, 41802, '<td valign="top">Great concept! I love the yellow door.</td>', 'Great concept! I love the yellow door.', '2005-10-21 21:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
