(1803879, 246170, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this has some personal meaning to you, but for me it''s just a bunch of names and numbers. Your title of "A: Domination" doesn''t help clarify, but further confuses me, and compared with other entries in the challenge doesn''t appeal to me. Therefore I have given it a low score. Sorry.</td>', 'I''m guessing this has some personal meaning to you, but for me it''s just a bunch of names and numbers. Your title of "A: Domination" doesn''t help clarify, but further confuses me, and compared with other entries in the challenge doesn''t appeal to me. Therefore I have given it a low score. Sorry.', '2005-10-22 21:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803882, 245033, 41675, '<td valign="top">Well, I have no idea what your title implies, but that''s kind of a moot point in this wide open "what" challenge. I''m not sure what this is a blur of, and without some kind of focal point, to me, it''s just a green motion blur. Therefore I have given it a low score. Sorry.</td>', 'Well, I have no idea what your title implies, but that''s kind of a moot point in this wide open "what" challenge. I''m not sure what this is a blur of, and without some kind of focal point, to me, it''s just a green motion blur. Therefore I have given it a low score. Sorry.', '2005-10-22 21:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803884, 244354, 41675, '<td valign="top">Although a funny photo, I find the light too overpowering on either side of the dog''s head.  Had there been a bit more focus around the eyes and a bit better lighting behind, I would have scored this better. Cute idea though - does show fun creativity.</td>', 'Although a funny photo, I find the light too overpowering on either side of the dog''s head.  Had there been a bit more focus around the eyes and a bit better lighting behind, I would have scored this better. Cute idea though - does show fun creativity.', '2005-10-22 21:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803889, 245941, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I don''t mind seeing some post-editing manipulation, but this seems overly processed. The magenta is blown way out there, but then again, that could be the effect you were going for. I do wonder what the original was like before manipulation.</td>', 'For me, I don''t mind seeing some post-editing manipulation, but this seems overly processed. The magenta is blown way out there, but then again, that could be the effect you were going for. I do wonder what the original was like before manipulation.', '2005-10-22 21:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803894, 245299, 41675, '<td valign="top">While it''s a nice enough waterfall shot, for me, it doesn''t quite fit into the "What" challenge. I wonder how a different time of day with brigher lighting would look to give the overall photo more saturation and color. The rock face looks a bit flat IMO.</td>', 'While it''s a nice enough waterfall shot, for me, it doesn''t quite fit into the "What" challenge. I wonder how a different time of day with brigher lighting would look to give the overall photo more saturation and color. The rock face looks a bit flat IMO.', '2005-10-22 21:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803899, 243658, 41675, '<td valign="top">Kind of a funny photo, but there are many distracting elements in the background for me. The case of Bud Light, the white chairs, the back end of the car, etc. It does show a sense of creativity and humor, but I have given it a low score compared to other entries in this challenge.</td>', 'Kind of a funny photo, but there are many distracting elements in the background for me. The case of Bud Light, the white chairs, the back end of the car, etc. It does show a sense of creativity and humor, but I have given it a low score compared to other entries in this challenge.', '2005-10-22 21:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
