(1803902, 244312, 41675, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo of a...friend? For me, this has a snapshot kind of quality and compared to other entries in this challenge doesn''t hold my interest. I do like the off-centered composition though.</td>', 'An interesting photo of a...friend? For me, this has a snapshot kind of quality and compared to other entries in this challenge doesn''t hold my interest. I do like the off-centered composition though.', '2005-10-22 21:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
