(1803907, 244457, 41675, '<td valign="top">This image reminds me more of a still from some Hollywood movie where a football star is "heading towards the light" The flare on the football player''s arm is distracting to me, and it took my eyes a few minutes to see the people in the background because that main light source is so over powering.</td>', 'This image reminds me more of a still from some Hollywood movie where a football star is "heading towards the light" The flare on the football player''s arm is distracting to me, and it took my eyes a few minutes to see the people in the background because that main light source is so over powering.', '2005-10-22 21:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803910, 245766, 41675, '<td valign="top">Fun cow sculptures, but for me, it doesn''t have the "what" appeal of other entries. Perhaps because it is so discernable as sculpures of cows in a city park. I do like the lighting on the buildings in the background though.</td>', 'Fun cow sculptures, but for me, it doesn''t have the "what" appeal of other entries. Perhaps because it is so discernable as sculpures of cows in a city park. I do like the lighting on the buildings in the background though.', '2005-10-22 21:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803912, 245499, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, not being a baseball fan, I have no idea how your title fits this photo. I like the lighting and shadow cast by the tree, but the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest as well as other entries in this challenge.</td>', 'Hmmm, not being a baseball fan, I have no idea how your title fits this photo. I like the lighting and shadow cast by the tree, but the subject matter doesn''t hold my interest as well as other entries in this challenge.', '2005-10-22 21:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
