(1803920, 243730, 41675, '<td valign="top">A very derranged photo. I wonder if you were going for some kind of shock value? If so, I imagine you are receiving many comments. I like the lighting on the doll in the foreground, but your image is disturbing to me.</td>', 'A very derranged photo. I wonder if you were going for some kind of shock value? If so, I imagine you are receiving many comments. I like the lighting on the doll in the foreground, but your image is disturbing to me.', '2005-10-22 22:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
