(1803926, 245111, 41675, '<td valign="top">I think it''s cool this rainbow was captured at night - I''ve never seen or heard of such a thing. The trees and that one branch just to the right of center are distracting for me though. I wonder how this would have looked if there was more sky than foreground - thereby taking the rainbow out from the dead center of your photo?</td>', 'I think it''s cool this rainbow was captured at night - I''ve never seen or heard of such a thing. The trees and that one branch just to the right of center are distracting for me though. I wonder how this would have looked if there was more sky than foreground - thereby taking the rainbow out from the dead center of your photo?', '2005-10-22 22:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803927, 246141, 41675, '<td valign="top">My least favortie part of your photo are the benches (?) in the background. My favorite part is the shadow. I wonder how this would look if more of that large element at the top was cropped out a bit more?</td>', 'My least favortie part of your photo are the benches (?) in the background. My favorite part is the shadow. I wonder how this would look if more of that large element at the top was cropped out a bit more?', '2005-10-22 22:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803929, 245601, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your use of black and white for this photo. I think it gives it a more dramatic effect. For me though, the fence is somewhat distracting as my eyes "peer" through it.</td>', 'I like your use of black and white for this photo. I think it gives it a more dramatic effect. For me though, the fence is somewhat distracting as my eyes "peer" through it.', '2005-10-22 22:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803932, 243959, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the off centered composition. The highlights are a bit bright on my screen. I wonder how they would look toned down a bit. Also, when I look at his head the fabric in the background makes it look like he has a couple of horns coming out of his head - especially at the top and to the right.</td>', 'I like the off centered composition. The highlights are a bit bright on my screen. I wonder how they would look toned down a bit. Also, when I look at his head the fabric in the background makes it look like he has a couple of horns coming out of his head - especially at the top and to the right.', '2005-10-22 22:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803935, 245775, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the animal''s stance you captured. The overall color and saturation looks a bit...odd to me. I also wonder if a photo like this would work better as a horizontal so the tail could fit in and not be cut off?</td>', 'I like the animal''s stance you captured. The overall color and saturation looks a bit...odd to me. I also wonder if a photo like this would work better as a horizontal so the tail could fit in and not be cut off?', '2005-10-22 22:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803938, 245893, 41675, '<td valign="top">I can see the likeness of the mickey head outline - although with an enlarged ear<br/>:-) For me, I would have liked a bit more of the bottom cropped off as it pulls my eyes to the bottom of the photo, when I think the lighter areas at top are more interesting.</td>', 'I can see the likeness of the mickey head outline - although with an enlarged ear:-) For me, I would have liked a bit more of the bottom cropped off as it pulls my eyes to the bottom of the photo, when I think the lighter areas at top are more interesting.', '2005-10-22 22:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803939, 244184, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''ve been viewing your photo for a few minutes and I''m not sure how this fits into the what category for me. I really like the lighting on the stalks, yet compared to other entries doesn''t quite meet the challenge for me.</td>', 'I''ve been viewing your photo for a few minutes and I''m not sure how this fits into the what category for me. I really like the lighting on the stalks, yet compared to other entries doesn''t quite meet the challenge for me.', '2005-10-22 22:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803942, 246270, 41675, '<td valign="top">My eyes follow where your subject is pointing and that leads me right out of your photo and I ignore the right half of it. Also, with his left hand at his waist...it makes me think he need to use nature''s bathroom.</td>', 'My eyes follow where your subject is pointing and that leads me right out of your photo and I ignore the right half of it. Also, with his left hand at his waist...it makes me think he need to use nature''s bathroom.', '2005-10-22 22:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803950, 246278, 41675, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot. I like the fish and the plant in the middle. I find the blurriness of the right hand side detracts from the overall photo. I wonder how this would look if you cropped it in a bit more from the right?</td>', 'Not a bad shot. I like the fish and the plant in the middle. I find the blurriness of the right hand side detracts from the overall photo. I wonder how this would look if you cropped it in a bit more from the right?', '2005-10-22 22:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803951, 245218, 41675, '<td valign="top">I actually like the left hand side of your photo (the background) the best. The tan/brown background element on the left is distracting and my eyes keep getting drawn there and away from your main subject.</td>', 'I actually like the left hand side of your photo (the background) the best. The tan/brown background element on the left is distracting and my eyes keep getting drawn there and away from your main subject.', '2005-10-22 22:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803954, 246137, 41675, '<td valign="top">The highlights from the flash are a little harsh here and there, but you did capture some rich rust tones. Reminds me of underground caverns I''ve toured in upstate NY.</td>', 'The highlights from the flash are a little harsh here and there, but you did capture some rich rust tones. Reminds me of underground caverns I''ve toured in upstate NY.', '2005-10-22 22:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803956, 244337, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I would like to see this photo rotated counter-clockwise so the taxi was on "even" ground. Also, I find the telephone pole distracting. I do get the irony of the cab company name and a cab with no hood though.</td>', 'For me, I would like to see this photo rotated counter-clockwise so the taxi was on "even" ground. Also, I find the telephone pole distracting. I do get the irony of the cab company name and a cab with no hood though.', '2005-10-22 22:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803961, 244663, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow - now that''s a very orange pumpkin! For me, I wish there was a bit more... "breathing room" on either side as it looks a bit squished in the frame.</td>', 'Wow - now that''s a very orange pumpkin! For me, I wish there was a bit more... "breathing room" on either side as it looks a bit squished in the frame.', '2005-10-22 22:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803964, 246366, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I would have found this more intriguing if your photo had been cropped in more from the right hand side - almost right up to the main element. This would eliminate some of the background distraction, the green cord, the pale tan/pinkish flare, and off-centered your subject too. Shows creativity though, and that''s always a good thing.</td>', 'For me, I would have found this more intriguing if your photo had been cropped in more from the right hand side - almost right up to the main element. This would eliminate some of the background distraction, the green cord, the pale tan/pinkish flare, and off-centered your subject too. Shows creativity though, and that''s always a good thing.', '2005-10-22 22:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803967, 246153, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your concept, but for me I wish you had pulled back more. So that there was more room on either side. The faces look crowded in the photo to me.</td>', 'I like your concept, but for me I wish you had pulled back more. So that there was more room on either side. The faces look crowded in the photo to me.', '2005-10-22 22:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1803972, 246450, 41675, '<td valign="top">Looks like the inside of a shell to me. My favorite part is the upper right hand corner. Some of the flash highlights are a bit strong. Also, I wonder how this would look it you completely cropped out the bottom element which would concentrate the viewer''s focus more on the upper part of your shot?</td>', 'Looks like the inside of a shell to me. My favorite part is the upper right hand corner. Some of the flash highlights are a bit strong. Also, I wonder how this would look it you completely cropped out the bottom element which would concentrate the viewer''s focus more on the upper part of your shot?', '2005-10-22 22:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
