(1806319, 244180, 33542, '<td valign="top">I''m not a huge fan of the title or the border, but the butterflies (moths?) themselves are pretty.</td>', 'I''m not a huge fan of the title or the border, but the butterflies (moths?) themselves are pretty.', '2005-10-24 01:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806329, 244306, 33542, '<td valign="top">very cool... I can''t tell what that orange thing is, but it''s got a great luminous quality (even aside from the light trail)... only two small criticisms: 1. don''t like the border 2. you can see something in the background - probably a hand or something which you could have edited out in advanced, but not in basic... overall this is one of my favorites, though.</td>', 'very cool... I can''t tell what that orange thing is, but it''s got a great luminous quality (even aside from the light trail)... only two small criticisms: 1. don''t like the border 2. you can see something in the background - probably a hand or something which you could have edited out in advanced, but not in basic... overall this is one of my favorites, though.', '2005-10-24 01:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806330, 243728, 33542, '<td valign="top">cute - I''d have preferred the pic to be a little bigger, though</td>', 'cute - I''d have preferred the pic to be a little bigger, though', '2005-10-24 01:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806331, 243797, 33542, '<td valign="top">lol - one of my favorites  :)</td>', 'lol - one of my favorites  :)', '2005-10-24 01:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806335, 245664, 33542, '<td valign="top">What ARE they doing???</td>', 'What ARE they doing???', '2005-10-24 01:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806350, 244337, 33542, '<td valign="top">lol, this is one of my favorite photos in terms of subject matter! A few things I think would have improved it a little, though: 1. desaturate the red a little 2. try not to blow the highlights (e.g. by using lower ISO, smaller aperture, or using exposure compensation), 3. watch reflections which gave you the weird green thing in the middle of the shot (maybe by using a different angle). maybe a different crop in which taxi plays a more prominent role.</td>', 'lol, this is one of my favorite photos in terms of subject matter! A few things I think would have improved it a little, though: 1. desaturate the red a little 2. try not to blow the highlights (e.g. by using lower ISO, smaller aperture, or using exposure compensation), 3. watch reflections which gave you the weird green thing in the middle of the shot (maybe by using a different angle). maybe a different crop in which taxi plays a more prominent role.', '2005-10-24 01:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806353, 244834, 33542, '<td valign="top">some parts of subject are a little out of focus and man''s face is too dark, but nice composition</td>', 'some parts of subject are a little out of focus and man''s face is too dark, but nice composition', '2005-10-24 01:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806357, 244663, 33542, '<td valign="top">not my favorite composition... maybe put pumpkin somewhere that you could crop less tightly</td>', 'not my favorite composition... maybe put pumpkin somewhere that you could crop less tightly', '2005-10-24 01:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806360, 246374, 33542, '<td valign="top">yikes - we got our first freezing rain today, but no ice like that yet!</td>', 'yikes - we got our first freezing rain today, but no ice like that yet!', '2005-10-24 01:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806362, 245906, 33542, '<td valign="top">lol... I love the photos that really fit the theme</td>', 'lol... I love the photos that really fit the theme', '2005-10-24 01:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806366, 245055, 33542, '<td valign="top">yeah, go sox!   would have preferred more contrast and less saturation, though... maybe that was to fit the "what?" theme, but it detracts from the quality of the photo imo</td>', 'yeah, go sox!   would have preferred more contrast and less saturation, though... maybe that was to fit the "what?" theme, but it detracts from the quality of the photo imo', '2005-10-24 01:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
