(1806543, 245773, 23891, '<td valign="top">Suggestion: Raise the black point in your photo to give it better contrast. It''s also over exposed so that you can''t see the details in the fur.</td>', 'Suggestion: Raise the black point in your photo to give it better contrast. It''s also over exposed so that you can''t see the details in the fur.', '2005-10-24 02:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
