(1806569, 245307, 37320, '<td valign="top">I just started voting a second ago, but this was the kind of stufff I was hoping to see in this challenge,  Good luck!  I love how uncontested and original this shot is.</td>', 'I just started voting a second ago, but this was the kind of stufff I was hoping to see in this challenge,  Good luck!  I love how uncontested and original this shot is.', '2005-10-24 03:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
