(1806577, 245945, 37320, '<td valign="top">Now here we have a beautiful picture of a buck in a field.  What is missing is the attitude, you know what I mean.  The deer should be sniiffing an abandoned golf club or have lawn ornaments stuck in his antlers or something random like that, Pizazz me some, You got the technique down, just give me some POW!</td>', 'Now here we have a beautiful picture of a buck in a field.  What is missing is the attitude, you know what I mean.  The deer should be sniiffing an abandoned golf club or have lawn ornaments stuck in his antlers or something random like that, Pizazz me some, You got the technique down, just give me some POW!', '2005-10-24 03:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806578, 246450, 24486, '<td valign="top">My first guess, a sea shell</td>', 'My first guess, a sea shell', '2005-10-24 03:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806580, 245880, 37320, '<td valign="top">Great capture, This is probable one of the best pet portraits I''ve ever seen.  And Honestly, I hate black and white, but It works wonders here.  Good luck</td>', 'Great capture, This is probable one of the best pet portraits I''ve ever seen.  And Honestly, I hate black and white, but It works wonders here.  Good luck', '2005-10-24 03:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
