(1806583, 246341, 37320, '<td valign="top">These abstract photos usually rub me the wrong way, but this one just fits well and it was just plain and simply well done...good luck.</td>', 'These abstract photos usually rub me the wrong way, but this one just fits well and it was just plain and simply well done...good luck.', '2005-10-24 03:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806588, 246416, 37320, '<td valign="top">Good capture and concept. I would like to see it maybe worked in a way such that both Capivara or whatever are more distinct, at the whispering point there is some lighting issue that I am too novice of a photographer to tell you how to fix...matter of fact I this comment isnt really helpful, but Ive come this far and I must say those are some nice pets you have there.</td>', 'Good capture and concept. I would like to see it maybe worked in a way such that both Capivara or whatever are more distinct, at the whispering point there is some lighting issue that I am too novice of a photographer to tell you how to fix...matter of fact I this comment isnt really helpful, but Ive come this far and I must say those are some nice pets you have there.', '2005-10-24 03:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806593, 245380, 37320, '<td valign="top">This is a really appealing photograph and it is without a doubt a keeper, that said I am really disappointed that this challenge topic is wasted with a photo that seems more suitable in an open challennge or something.  Put in other words, this shot isnt wierd enough.</td>', 'This is a really appealing photograph and it is without a doubt a keeper, that said I am really disappointed that this challenge topic is wasted with a photo that seems more suitable in an open challennge or something.  Put in other words, this shot isnt wierd enough.', '2005-10-24 03:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806594, 245491, 37320, '<td valign="top">kind of a nice nostalgic sorta photo, but It just doesn''t bring out the What?! in me.</td>', 'kind of a nice nostalgic sorta photo, but It just doesn''t bring out the What?! in me.', '2005-10-24 03:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806596, 243778, 37320, '<td valign="top">Its a shame you and your ghost have to share one pair of underpants.  But then again non-material aparitions dont put too much wear and tear on undergarments anyways.</td>', 'Its a shame you and your ghost have to share one pair of underpants.  But then again non-material aparitions dont put too much wear and tear on undergarments anyways.', '2005-10-24 03:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806597, 244284, 37320, '<td valign="top">Sort of has a nice Eschereque quality to it, I still cant figure out if im looking up or down, which in this challenge is a plus.</td>', 'Sort of has a nice Eschereque quality to it, I still cant figure out if im looking up or down, which in this challenge is a plus.', '2005-10-24 03:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806599, 244394, 37320, '<td valign="top">If he had chicken feathers in his helmet or, was wearing lab goggles this picture may be more apt for the challenge, unfortunately this shot just isn''t confusing enough to meet my criteria for this challenge, albeit a good shot and great capture, the appeal isnt there for this challenge.</td>', 'If he had chicken feathers in his helmet or, was wearing lab goggles this picture may be more apt for the challenge, unfortunately this shot just isn''t confusing enough to meet my criteria for this challenge, albeit a good shot and great capture, the appeal isnt there for this challenge.', '2005-10-24 03:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806601, 243658, 37320, '<td valign="top">Perfect shot for the challenge, if only you had better equipment!  Good effort in setup and great creativity and topic appropriateness.</td>', 'Perfect shot for the challenge, if only you had better equipment!  Good effort in setup and great creativity and topic appropriateness.', '2005-10-24 03:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
