(1806618, 245108, 37320, '<td valign="top">Seriously!   Whats really funny about this picture is you probably took it in a country (perhaps your own) where you understand that. However, knowing that most of the world wont be able to read that you enter it...and it works, cause I have no idea what that means.</td>', 'Seriously!   Whats really funny about this picture is you probably took it in a country (perhaps your own) where you understand that. However, knowing that most of the world wont be able to read that you enter it...and it works, cause I have no idea what that means.', '2005-10-24 03:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806674, 245111, 43753, '<td valign="top">There is something encanting about this photographe. Maybe it is the soft orange of the trees in the foreground or the tiny bit of blue sky peeking through the cloud cover. Not to mention the rainbow at night - I have never seen anything like it.</td>', 'There is something encanting about this photographe. Maybe it is the soft orange of the trees in the foreground or the tiny bit of blue sky peeking through the cloud cover. Not to mention the rainbow at night - I have never seen anything like it.', '2005-10-24 04:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
