(1806679, 244013, 43753, '<td valign="top">I actually said "What?" when I saw this, so this is already a winner in my book.</td>', 'I actually said "What?" when I saw this, so this is already a winner in my book.', '2005-10-24 04:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806681, 246194, 43753, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this photo, but the image quality isn''t all that good. I do love the cool (temp) color and pattern made by fish.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this photo, but the image quality isn''t all that good. I do love the cool (temp) color and pattern made by fish.', '2005-10-24 04:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806683, 243529, 43753, '<td valign="top">I think your lighting looks great. The image might have more "What" apeal if you had turned the image to the left. I think your background is blurred enough that it wouldn''t be obvious. It would look really weird to have her little ponytail sticking straight out.</td>', 'I think your lighting looks great. The image might have more "What" apeal if you had turned the image to the left. I think your background is blurred enough that it wouldn''t be obvious. It would look really weird to have her little ponytail sticking straight out.', '2005-10-24 04:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806685, 244072, 43753, '<td valign="top">What''s so "Royal" about monile homes, huh? I like the texture and contrast here.</td>', 'What''s so "Royal" about monile homes, huh? I like the texture and contrast here.', '2005-10-24 04:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806691, 245411, 43753, '<td valign="top">Very interestng idea - my only complaint is that there is too much space at the top. I think the image would look better if it was cropped at the top. I do like the colors. The living plant coming up among all the rubble makes for an interesting metaphor.</td>', 'Very interestng idea - my only complaint is that there is too much space at the top. I think the image would look better if it was cropped at the top. I do like the colors. The living plant coming up among all the rubble makes for an interesting metaphor.', '2005-10-24 04:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806696, 244885, 43753, '<td valign="top">How beautiful. It is hard to capture deer. As soon as they hear the shutter they''re off. I think your background looks great, and the lighting and texture on the deer loook great. The only complaint I have is that it might look better if the left side of the image was cropped. I think it would look better if the deer''s head wasn''t centered. Just my opinion though - it is a pretty photo and excellent capture!</td>', 'How beautiful. It is hard to capture deer. As soon as they hear the shutter they''re off. I think your background looks great, and the lighting and texture on the deer loook great. The only complaint I have is that it might look better if the left side of the image was cropped. I think it would look better if the deer''s head wasn''t centered. Just my opinion though - it is a pretty photo and excellent capture!', '2005-10-24 04:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1806706, 245768, 46550, '<td valign="top">would have been better without the other leaves around it....</td>', 'would have been better without the other leaves around it....', '2005-10-24 04:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
