(1808449, 243544, 41200, '<td valign="top">A little trick that I''ll do when I''m shooting a detail image of an object, is to take a piece of tape &amp; wrap it around a couple of fingers, sticky side out. Then very gingerly brush the surface of the object I''m photographing. It does a nice job picking up those little specks of dust that my eyes tend to miss.  Great job capturing the texture! Blue Jay isn''t it?</td>', 'A little trick that I''ll do when I''m shooting a detail image of an object, is to take a piece of tape & wrap it around a couple of fingers, sticky side out. Then very gingerly brush the surface of the object I''m photographing. It does a nice job picking up those little specks of dust that my eyes tend to miss.  Great job capturing the texture! Blue Jay isn''t it?', '2005-10-24 20:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
