(1812607, 244957, 42638, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. would love to see this at a slightly higher angle though. This angle and the B&amp;W make it difficult to see.  I am assuming the leaves and acorns are the subject of the photo. I do like the texture here and the slightly brighter area in the middle.</td>', 'Interesting picture. would love to see this at a slightly higher angle though. This angle and the B&W make it difficult to see.  I am assuming the leaves and acorns are the subject of the photo. I do like the texture here and the slightly brighter area in the middle.', '2005-10-26 00:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1812608, 246249, 36299, '<td valign="top">Although the expression is good.  The background has to many light spots that detract from the image.  Not that it can be controlled, but it is still relevant.  because the image is duller then the background it would be almost impossible to mitigate the distraction.</td>', 'Although the expression is good.  The background has to many light spots that detract from the image.  Not that it can be controlled, but it is still relevant.  because the image is duller then the background it would be almost impossible to mitigate the distraction.', '2005-10-26 00:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
