(1812645, 245822, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, I live closer into the city so I don''t get these in my yard anymore, love these little guys! Nice picture. I would suggest cropping out some of the top portion of the picture, its a bit distracting. Great detail here, I really feel he is looking at me.</td>', 'Wow, I live closer into the city so I don''t get these in my yard anymore, love these little guys! Nice picture. I would suggest cropping out some of the top portion of the picture, its a bit distracting. Great detail here, I really feel he is looking at me.', '2005-10-26 00:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1812646, 243903, 43434, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t work with the table not appearing level in the picture.  It just hasn''t quite pulled off.</td>', 'This doesn''t work with the table not appearing level in the picture.  It just hasn''t quite pulled off.', '2005-10-26 00:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1812659, 243658, 42638, '<td valign="top">Wow, now this is interesting. Nice use of creativity and imagination. The picture is a bit small which makes it harder to see but seems like there are several distractions you might want to crop out or even blur to really enhance your subject.</td>', 'Wow, now this is interesting. Nice use of creativity and imagination. The picture is a bit small which makes it harder to see but seems like there are several distractions you might want to crop out or even blur to really enhance your subject.', '2005-10-26 00:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
