(1814441, 245547, 34192, '<td valign="top">I love most all of your abstracts.  This is not one of them - I gave you a 5.  For me, your abstracts are about motion.  This one doesn''t have a sense of movement about it.  I think it is due to the blue at the bottom.  It kind of stops the flow.  The colors here don''t stand out, they just lay there.  So many others you have created just jump off the page at me but this one didn''t do it.  Sorry!</td>', 'I love most all of your abstracts.  This is not one of them - I gave you a 5.  For me, your abstracts are about motion.  This one doesn''t have a sense of movement about it.  I think it is due to the blue at the bottom.  It kind of stops the flow.  The colors here don''t stand out, they just lay there.  So many others you have created just jump off the page at me but this one didn''t do it.  Sorry!', '2005-10-26 12:14:12.000000', NULL, 0),
