(1815759, 245547, 40386, '<td valign="top">I have been playing with slower shutter speeds and my horses (motion blur) lately but hesitate to post them because I dont think a lot of people will "get" them.  I liked this shot but also thought it was more a reflection than What.  It would look great framed on a wall, nice abstract.  It just didnt have that Wow factor that I look for when voting on this particular challenge but it is great in its own right!  A series of these in this style would be great as a collection.<br/> <br/>Edit to add, I have just looked at your portfolio and have to agree I saw more there that I love and make this one look a bit sterile in comparison, still like it though LOL.  Great shots!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-26 17:20:44.</i></td>', 'I have been playing with slower shutter speeds and my horses (motion blur) lately but hesitate to post them because I dont think a lot of people will "get" them.  I liked this shot but also thought it was more a reflection than What.  It would look great framed on a wall, nice abstract.  It just didnt have that Wow factor that I look for when voting on this particular challenge but it is great in its own right!  A series of these in this style would be great as a collection. Edit to add, I have just looked at your portfolio and have to agree I saw more there that I love and make this one look a bit sterile in comparison, still like it though LOL.  Great shots!', '2005-10-26 18:17:45.000000', '2005-10-26 18:20:44.000000', 0),
