(1816199, 243932, 34659, '<td valign="top">Based on your forum thread, I''m adding this comment.  I scored this a 5 for several reasons.  I think the crop should have been much tighter - you caught a great expression...  zero in on it!  Also, the subject is too centered - offset him a bit.  Finally, the lighting is a bit harsh and the colors a bit washed out - I think if you had played with the lighting/exposure/contrast and bumped up the color sat a bit, you could have improved the "pop" value.  It''s not a bad shot at all, I just think it could have been processed better.</td>', 'Based on your forum thread, I''m adding this comment.  I scored this a 5 for several reasons.  I think the crop should have been much tighter - you caught a great expression...  zero in on it!  Also, the subject is too centered - offset him a bit.  Finally, the lighting is a bit harsh and the colors a bit washed out - I think if you had played with the lighting/exposure/contrast and bumped up the color sat a bit, you could have improved the "pop" value.  It''s not a bad shot at all, I just think it could have been processed better.', '2005-10-26 21:22:12.000000', NULL, 0),
