(1816521, 245901, 3554, '<td valign="top">I have a pit bull rescue I named "Chance" same basic story, she was six months old and had lived almost her entire life in the pound. They were doing everything they could to get her adopted. She''s a big favorite with everyone who meets her and plays very well with other dogs. Be aware that their animal aggression can take a few years to show up and it can come out of the blue. So always supervise same sex play pals and never go to a dog park. Even if a pitbull doesn''t start a fight they will finish it. When she plays she shows her natural fighting ability and I have no doubt in my mind she could rip another dog to shreds if she wanted to. So far she just wants to play though.  :)</td>', 'I have a pit bull rescue I named "Chance" same basic story, she was six months old and had lived almost her entire life in the pound. They were doing everything they could to get her adopted. She''s a big favorite with everyone who meets her and plays very well with other dogs. Be aware that their animal aggression can take a few years to show up and it can come out of the blue. So always supervise same sex play pals and never go to a dog park. Even if a pitbull doesn''t start a fight they will finish it. When she plays she shows her natural fighting ability and I have no doubt in my mind she could rip another dog to shreds if she wanted to. So far she just wants to play though.  :)', '2005-10-26 23:07:41.000000', NULL, 0),
