(1817229, 245982, 37893, '<td valign="top">I missed this during the challenge but I would have given this an 8 just for pur originality! As far as the shadows are concerned I think if you stood a few more inches away from the wall and bounced the flashm some of the shadows wouldn''t be as obvious. The desat and color saturation works well - not really BW but not really color. I think it''s just the right amount for this image to be effective. And by your placement, everyone seems to have thought so too :D</td>', 'I missed this during the challenge but I would have given this an 8 just for pur originality! As far as the shadows are concerned I think if you stood a few more inches away from the wall and bounced the flashm some of the shadows wouldn''t be as obvious. The desat and color saturation works well - not really BW but not really color. I think it''s just the right amount for this image to be effective. And by your placement, everyone seems to have thought so too :D', '2005-10-27 04:15:21.000000', NULL, 0),
