(1820474, 245913, 42233, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by holiday:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh, man! And I thought you are going to take a ribbon! I scored you a 9. It seems that these people do not know "foreign languages"... Don''t give up. It is still one of the best (if not the best) photo in the competition. Good luck for the future. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanke you! I really don´t understand system of voting here! But this is no problem I''m here for learning something! Toni</td>', 'Originally posted by holiday: Oh, man! And I thought you are going to take a ribbon! I scored you a 9. It seems that these people do not know "foreign languages"... Don''t give up. It is still one of the best (if not the best) photo in the competition. Good luck for the future.   Thanke you! I really don´t understand system of voting here! But this is no problem I''m here for learning something! Toni', '2005-10-28 08:35:42.000000', NULL, 0),
