(1823979, 245906, 30707, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much! This is my first picture I posted in a challenge and not my last, I can tell you that. People have been asking how I did it and I''m gonna tell you how. It''s very simple! The band got a sponsor from Dressmann for there 70''s golf outfit. We went to the golf course and I made them jump as high as they could while I layed with my face to the grass and took shot after shot just framing them and the sky. Result... better then I ever dreamed about. Thank you so much again for your comments and ratings!!</td>', 'Thank you so much! This is my first picture I posted in a challenge and not my last, I can tell you that. People have been asking how I did it and I''m gonna tell you how. It''s very simple! The band got a sponsor from Dressmann for there 70''s golf outfit. We went to the golf course and I made them jump as high as they could while I layed with my face to the grass and took shot after shot just framing them and the sky. Result... better then I ever dreamed about. Thank you so much again for your comments and ratings!!', '2005-10-30 00:18:38.000000', NULL, 0),
