(1868528, 243682, 42389, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pix-are:</b></div><hr/><i> This is really amazing.  How did you do it? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I''m too lazy to explain how I froze my wristwatch. Lighting is simlpe. Lightbox and on top of that black cardboard. Cutted a hole into cardboard, and placed the ice sculpture above the hole (image is upside down).<br/> <br/>Now I realise that the hole should''ve been much smaller.</td>', 'Originally posted by pix-are: This is really amazing.  How did you do it?  I''m too lazy to explain how I froze my wristwatch. Lighting is simlpe. Lightbox and on top of that black cardboard. Cutted a hole into cardboard, and placed the ice sculpture above the hole (image is upside down). Now I realise that the hole should''ve been much smaller.', '2005-11-15 12:49:49.000000', NULL, 0),
