(2041187, 244108, 17507, '<td valign="top">you''re right, the detail retention is impressive-<br/>check this out-<br/> <br/>2560x1920 = 4915200 pixels<br/>711x502 = 356922 pixels<br/> <br/>356922/4915200 = 7.26%<br/> <br/>Rather than 26% of the image area, your crop was actually only 7.26% - and the detail is still that good. WOW!</td>', 'you''re right, the detail retention is impressive-check this out- 2560x1920 = 4915200 pixels711x502 = 356922 pixels 356922/4915200 = 7.26% Rather than 26% of the image area, your crop was actually only 7.26% - and the detail is still that good. WOW!', '2006-01-16 05:14:47.000000', NULL, 0),
